|---|---|---|---|---|
| Crimson Inferno (`crimson-inferno`) | 1 | Walls of red gas round a white-hot heart; lava-veined worlds | Heat 1, Nebula .8, Asteroids .4 | Stellar heat, burning gas, flares |
| Golden Dust (`golden-dust`) | 1 | Amber haze thick with dust, a sun glaring through it | Dust 1, Asteroids .8, Graveyard .6 | Dust banks, poor sensor range, rock fields |
