Retires 56 ability ids across 38 merges and mints 4 new family ids. The cluster kits were already shared, so every merge is a class''s own near-copy folding into a sibling move. The survivor''s numbers win unless noted.

- Vanguard (-4): Shield Wall (Defender) and Holy Bulwark (Paladin) become a new vanguard_bulwark (Cross r1 Ward, CD 4); Rallying Banner folds into Rally Point; Juggernaut Charge into Overrun; Phalanx Hook into Grappling Hook.
- Blade (-6): Perfect Cut (identical), Iaijutsu and Contract Kill fold into Decisive Cut; Lance Charge into Running Riot; Masterless Cut into Hit and Run; Flurry into Wide Cleave.
- Brawn (-7): Skull Crack and Dirty Trick fold into Skull Rattle; Haymaker and Knockout Punch into Knockout Combo, which keeps the 50% Asleep; Combo Strike and Jab-Cross into One-Two Flurry; the Berserk passive into Blood Rage.
- Shadow (-12): the 6 ninja fangs and Night Stalk become a new ninja_fang: 14 damage of the wearer''s element, with that element''s rider (Chroma: Physical 18). The 4 elemental edge passives become a new ninja_edge (Venom Edge stays, since Slasher shares it). This needs a small engine seam: a per-class element for an ability. Killing Blow and Finishing Blow fold into Exploit the Opening; Rend into Exploit.
- Wild (-8): Lion''s Roar folds into Pack Rally. The 3 hex shots and Binding Shot become a new hex_shot (Dark 14 + Slowed, CD 3). Deadeye Shot folds into Quickshot; Rapid Barrage into Called Shot (the same move at a worse cooldown); Piercing Volley and Covering Volley into Suppressing Fire.
- Machina (-5): Ward Grid folds into Suppression Mine; System Shock into Overdrive Tap; Jury-Rig into Field Patch, which gains Cleanse at CD 3; Diagnostic Strike into Turret Barrage; Chill Aura into Shock Plating.
- Arcane (-3): Elemental Fury folds into Meteor; Swift Relay into Shortcut; Hinder into Disrupt.
- Occult (-5): Blood Rite folds into Festering Mark; Enervating Touch and Venomous Grip into Bloodletting Bite; Jade Resolve into Dark Communion; Dark Rite into Shadow Bolt.
- Grace (-6): Divine Grace and Arcane Ward fold into Preemptive Ward; Transmute Pain into Field Triage (Protection is dropped); Inner Peace into Moonlit Recovery; Sage''s Insight into Disrupt; Rebloom into Inner Calm, which takes Rebloom''s numbers.

Every listed situational ability stays a signature, along with: Knight''s Oath; Warden''s Stand Guard, Reveille and Lantern; Valkyrie''s Call; Riposte; Fleche; Set Spear; Reckless Swing; Bamboo Slam; Flowing Palm; Plunder Strike; Snatch; Blitz Rush; Execution Shot; Pitfall Volley; Snare Net; Tame; Overclock; Frost Nova; Omen; Mirror Skin; Whirling Ward; Countermarch; Encore; Soul Feast; Dread Aura; Benediction; Mana Pour; Lifegift. Float has no hero ability in content yet; it is reserved as a signature.

Calls for you:
1. The ninja element variant needs a small engine seam.
2. Moves that lose a rider: Contract Kill''s boss bonus, Transmute''s Protection, Holy Bulwark''s party-wide reach.
3. Folding Hinder into Disrupt weakens the Tactician''s tempo kit.

