Rules: change live references only (code, config, scripts, current docs); leave dated records as they are (USER_STORIES ticket rows, changelogs/AMENDMENTS, quicksaves, .agent session files, EF migration *.Designer.cs). Verify by building only; tests are run by the owner via /test. One commit ending in this ticket''s ID.', '2026-11-24T16:15:46Z');

## Scope
Erase from the LIVE Gadfly database (and its blob storage) every piece of per-user exam activity:
exam sessions/attempts, turns/transcripts/responses, captures and recordings (DB rows and blobs),
grades, panel verdicts, rubric scores, feedback, appeals, inbox messages and notifications, emails queued,
grading/reminder/job queue rows, LTI passback rows, integrity/proctoring flags, analytics and
calibration rows derived from sessions, response backfill state.

KEEP: user accounts (admin, ryan, erin) with their passwords, MFA and emails; organizations,
memberships, courses and assignments; exams, the 102-exam catalog, rubrics, question banks;
config, API keys; schema and migration history. Audit log: keep, and add one entry recording the reset.

## How
