- Live previews using the game''s exact math: board token (square in the token frame), timeline icon (circle, hero / enemy / boss ring colours), and a menu-card thumb.
- Save (Ctrl+S) writes only that class''s `"Thumbnail"` block back into `classes.json`, keeping the rest of the file byte-identical (same 2-space JSON layout). Prev/Next unit (PgUp/PgDn).
- A launcher (`tools/thumbnail-studio.ps1`) builds and runs it.
