- Today: Pages\Settings.razor app-level parts; drop the IdiotProof.Settings RCL (ccd6119); per-user SettingsKv stays
- Keys: claude, openai, gemini, deepseek, mistral; alpaca. Declare `[UsesCredential]`s; resolve keys through `KeySelector` and the shared named lists (no per-app copies).
- Add `--write-settings-manifest` (seed + manifest, then exit) to its run script.
- Remove its app-level settings UI; point its cog at `VaultSettings.Open("<appId>")`.
- Import **today''s actual values** (not just defaults) from wherever they live now into the new settings class, organized into labeled groups, and remap every consumer in the app to read them by their new `{AppId}:{Property}` name.
- Its settings cog/menu opens Vault.Desktop at this app''s tab (`VaultSettings.Open`); verified by hand.
- Tests: **one separate test per setting** proving it works end to end (today''s stored value imports to the right name, round-trips through Vault, and is the value the app actually reads/uses at runtime); manifest has every field labeled; LoadOrSeed seeds the expected defaults; LLM calls fail over (first key 401 -> second used); old settings UI/route is gone.
