  (Orchestrator and Tickets) get it together. The MAUI epic (M.ORCH-T1196) was retired
  (M.ORCH-T1292): WPF stays the one desktop shell, so there is no second shell to keep in sync.
- The named-pipe bus stays as a permanent fallback: nothing depends on Relay to keep working.

