  (design section 7): its own `<app>.>` space plus the commands it may call.
- `relay creds issue <app>` writes the credential into MindAttic.Vault (DPAPI); `revoke` adds it to the account''s
  revocation list (live connections drop); `list` shows apps, permissions and expiry.
- Permission profiles for the first apps: orch, tix, prose, kdp, relay-admin.
- Replaces the bootstrap credentials the server-install ticket created.

