Scene.NavMesh.CalculatePath in editor play mode: every leg from the stair-3 top landing down
through both flights to back_door reports Complete). But a full `{"do":"goto","entity":"back_door"}`
from the bed/player start still fails: PlanRoute reports "NavMesh: Partial" and gets no useful
AiNodeGraph fallback (the parsed .ain graph has no nodes down the stairwell, so it only ever appends
