Cause: an escort has no motion of its own (it flies its leader''s, Ship.Controller; a hired or fresh escort has Orbit null and Phase Parked from creation). Two places leave it leaderless and gone without one:
1. Ship.Tombstone (Fleet.LetGo''s marker for a hull leaving through a gate or under its own drive) clears Leader on a MemberwiseClone of an escort.
2. Escorts.PayOffOrphans pays off a hired fighter (Destroyed, GateDeparted) and clears its Leader.
Both then read as parked with no orbit. Not the ''Lost track of its ring'' branch in ScheduleNext (checked: never reached here).

Fix (bug only, no gameplay change; already in Unreal.SpaceGod''s C++ port, US-T59): both take their leader''s motion before the leader is cleared, the field list War.Detach hands an escort leaving its group (Ship.TakeMotionOf). Only gone hulls change; the Bench''s five digests are byte-identical before and after on both tracks.

Verified headless (the Bench''s Simulation, New Game 2026-11-03 12:00 UTC seed 1, 20 s of Sol, then every ship of every system read with Fleet.StateOf each frame): unpatched NRE 12 frames into 1 yr/s; patched 0 throws over 10 years at 1 yr/s and 200 days at 1 month/s.

Patch (git apply --ignore-whitespace; the files are CRLF):

```diff
diff --git a/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Ships.cs b/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Ships.cs
index e277c68..29c44e0 100644
--- a/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Ships.cs
+++ b/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Ships.cs
@@ -877,6 +877,10 @@ namespace Unity.SpaceGod.Core
         internal Ship Tombstone()
         {
             var t = (Ship)MemberwiseClone();
+            // An escort flies its leader''s motion (Controller) and has none of its own (it may never have had an Orbit):
+            // its marker, leaderless, takes the group''s motion as War.Detach gives an escort leaving its group, so it reads
+            // where the hull last was rather than parked with no orbit (Fleet.StateOf threw on it every frame, US-T59).
+            if (Leader != null) t.TakeMotionOf(Leader);
             t.Destroyed = true;
             t.GateDeparted = true;
             t.Leader = null;
@@ -886,6 +890,45 @@ namespace Unity.SpaceGod.Core
             return t;
         }
 
+        /// <summary>
+        /// The motion War.Detach hands an escort leaving its group: its leader''s, field for field. For a hull gone from the
+        /// fleet as an escort (its marker, or a hired fighter paid off), so it reads where it last was (US-T59).
+        /// </summary>
+        internal void TakeMotionOf(Ship lead)
+        {
+            Phase = lead.Phase;
+            Orbit = lead.Orbit;
+            DepartureOrbit = lead.DepartureOrbit;
+            DestinationBody = lead.DestinationBody;
+            OriginBody = lead.OriginBody;
+            PhaseStartJd = lead.PhaseStartJd;
+            PhaseEndJd = lead.PhaseEndJd;
+            FrameBody = lead.FrameBody;
+            Path = lead.Path;
+            PathCumulative = lead.PathCumulative;
+            PathLength = lead.PathLength;
+            AccelKmPerDay2 = lead.AccelKmPerDay2;
+            Conic = lead.Conic;
+            GravityLossKmS = lead.GravityLossKmS;
+            DepartureVelocity = lead.DepartureVelocity;
+            ArrivalVelocity = lead.ArrivalVelocity;
+            Journey = lead.Journey;
+            JourneyIndex = lead.JourneyIndex;
+            FinalBody = lead.FinalBody;
+            LaneLeg = lead.LaneLeg;
+            LaneFromOffset = lead.LaneFromOffset;
+            LaneToOffset = lead.LaneToOffset;
+            LaneLengthKm = lead.LaneLengthKm;
+            LaneStartProgress = lead.LaneStartProgress;
+            LaneEndProgress = lead.LaneEndProgress;
+            LaneHold = lead.LaneHold;
+            LaneHoldSide = lead.LaneHoldSide;
+            LaneStar = lead.LaneStar;
+            LaneShape = lead.LaneShape;
+            Ring = lead.Ring;
+            HoldPoint = lead.HoldPoint;
+        }
+
         public override string ToString() => Name;
     }
 
diff --git a/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Economy/Escorts.cs b/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Economy/Escorts.cs
index 6d32b68..3699455 100644
--- a/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Economy/Escorts.cs
+++ b/Assets/UnitySpace/Core/Economy/Escorts.cs
@@ -168,6 +168,8 @@ namespace Unity.SpaceGod.Core
                 gone.Add(s);
                 s.Destroyed = true;
                 s.GateDeparted = true;
+                // Gone where its wing lay, not parked with no orbit of its own (an escort has none, US-T59).
+                if (s.Leader != null) s.TakeMotionOf(s.Leader);
                 s.Leader = null;
             }
             foreach (var s in gone) hired.Remove(s);
```', '2026-11-04T06:42:15Z');

